        "title": "Grants, Incubators & College Seed Funding (Part 2)",
        "content": "- **Grant Amount:** Up to **₹50 LAKH** pure equity-free grant!\n- **Project Duration:** Up to 18 months.\n- **Who Can Apply?** Individual student researchers, academic scholars, professors, or registered early-stage biotech startups (< 5 years old).\n- **Eligible Expenses:** Lab raw materials, chemical reagents, specialized testing/trials, third-party clinical validation, prototyping equipment hire, IP patent filing fees, and project manpower stipends.\n- **Ineligible Expenses:** Real estate purchase, civil construction, or paying off existing business debts.\n\n---\n\n### 3. DST NIDHI-PRAYAS Grant Scheme\n\nThe **NIDHI-PRAYAS** (PRomoting and Accelerating Young and Aspiring innovators & Startups) program run by the Department of Science and Technology (DST), Government of India is an absolute lifeline for physical hardware, IoT, robotics, clean energy, and deep-tech product innovators!\n\n- **Grant Amount:** Up to **₹10 LAKH** for converting an innovative idea into a physical working prototype / MVP.\n- **Equity Requirement:** **0% Equity (Pure Grant).**\n- **Duration:** 12 to 18 months.\n- **FabLab / Maker Space Infrastructure:** Selected Prayasees get **free 24/7 access** to TBI's FabLabs, industrial 3D printers, CNC machining tools, laser cutters, oscilloscope testing equipment, and PCB prototyping labs!\n\n---\n\n### 4. NIDHI-EIR Fellowship & MeitY TIDE 2.0\n\n#### DST NIDHI-EIR (Entrepreneur-in-Residence) Fellowship\n- **What is it?** A monthly living stipend grant designed specifically for graduating college students who want to skip traditional corporate campus placements and pursue entrepreneurship full-time without worrying about personal basic survival costs!\n- **Financial Benefit:** **₹10,000 to ₹30,000 per month** direct grant stipend for **12 months** (Total up to ₹3.6 Lakh) credited straight to the student founder's bank account so they can pay hostel/flat rent and buy food while building their startup!\n\n#### MeitY TIDE 2.0\n- **Grant Amount:** Up to **₹20 Lakh** for tech startups working in Healthcare, Education, Agriculture, FinTech, and Social Impact sectors.\n- **Equity:** **0% (Non-Dilutive).**",
