        "title": "Case Studies & Student Founder Toolkit (Part 3)",
        "content": "---\n\n### Student Founder Financial & Legal Master Checklist\n\nBefore launching your campus startup, check off every single item in this 10-step mandatory operational checklist:\n\n```\n┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                      STUDENT FOUNDER FINANCIAL MASTER CHECKLIST                        │\n├────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ [ ] STEP 1: Execute Founder Equity Agreement with 4-Year Vesting & 1-Year Cliff.       │\n│ [ ] STEP 2: Complete FREE Udyam MSME Registration on udyamregistration.gov.in.        │\n│ [ ] STEP 3: Apply for DPIIT Startup India Recognition on startupindia.gov.in.          │\n│ [ ] STEP 4: Open Zero-MAB / Low-MAB Corporate Current Account (SBI / RazorpayX).       │\n│ [ ] STEP 5: Sign IP Assignment Deed transferring all code/designs from founders to entity.│\n│ [ ] STEP 6: Apply for College TBI Incubation & DST NIDHI-PRAYAS / SISFS Grant Funds.   │\n│ [ ] STEP 7: File LUT (Letter of Undertaking) on GST Portal for Zero-Rated SaaS Exports.│\n│ [ ] STEP 8: Build 3-Tier Contribution Margin Model tracking CM1, CM2, CM3 and CAC:LTV. │\n│ [ ] STEP 9: Set up Automated Monthly Cash Burn Rate & 6-Month Runway Alert Dashboard.  │\n│ [ ] STEP 10: Standardize Term Sheet Review Checklist (Insist on 1x Non-Participating). │\n└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n---\n\n### Free Financial Model Templates Guide for Founders\n\nTo help you manage your startup finances like a professional VC-backed founder, here are the step-by-step mathematical formulas to build your 3 essential Excel / Google Sheets templates:\n\n#### Template 1: Automated Cap Table Engine (Google Sheets / Excel)\n- **Column Setup:**\n  - `A: Stakeholder Name`\n  - `B: Share Class (Equity / CCPS)`\n  - `C: Share Count`\n  - `D: Ownership Percentage Formula:` ` = C2 / SUM($C$2:$C$10)`\n  - `E: Post-Round Ownership (After New Investment):` `= D2 * (PreMoney / (PreMoney + NewInvestment))`\n\n#### Template 2: Unit Economics Dashboard\n- **Input Fields:** Product Price, COGS, Shipping Cost, Payment Gateway %, Ad Spend, Customers Acquired.\n- **Auto-Calculated Fields:** CM1, CM2, CM3, CAC, LTV, LTV:CAC Ratio, Break-Even Units.\n\n#### Template 3: Cash Runway Tracker\n- **Monthly Inputs:** Opening Balance, Revenue, Expenses (Salary, Rent, Marketing, Tools, Misc), Closing Balance.\n- **Dashboard Alert:** Conditional formatting turns RED when runway drops below 6 months.",
